        "label": "Launch — Saturn V",
        "description": "Kennedy Space Center Launch Complex 39A, 1972-04-16 17:54:00 UTC (12:54 p.m. EST). Saturn V lifts Young, Mattingly and Duke on the first mission to the lunar highlands."
